x86_64-windows  a handler in this case ends with `return`, and on this target a handler is a funclet - leaving one early means handing back the address to carry on at in the register a return value would travel in, which is not built yet. The class-typed throw it also needs landed for this target on 2026-09-26. Everything this case measures is the Itanium path in any event: there is no `__cxa_end_catch` on that ABI, a handler being a funclet the runtime ends the catch for when it returns.
